OCPP JSON Schemas
-----------------

The JSON schema files under cmd/generate-ocpp-types/schemas/ are published by
the Open Charge Alliance (OCA) as part of the Open Charge Point Protocol
specifications, and are redistributed here unmodified for use with the code
generator in cmd/generate-ocpp-types.

Covered schema sets:

  - OCPP 1.5   (cmd/generate-ocpp-types/schemas/1.5/)
  - OCPP 1.6   (cmd/generate-ocpp-types/schemas/1.6/)
  - OCPP 2.0.1 (cmd/generate-ocpp-types/schemas/2.0.1/)
  - OCPP 2.1   (cmd/generate-ocpp-types/schemas/2.1/)

The OCPP 2.1 schemas are licensed by the Open Charge Alliance under the
Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivatives 4.0 International Public License
(CC BY-ND 4.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nd/4.0/legalcode

The OCPP 1.5, 1.6, and 2.0.1 schemas are distributed by the Open Charge
Alliance under their published usage terms. See:

    https://openchargealliance.org/

Build-time transformations that the code generator applies to these schemas
(patches, extraction of shared definitions, `$ref` rewriting) are performed on
copies in a temporary directory during a `task generate` run and are not
redistributed.

OCPP WSDLs
----------

The WSDL files under cmd/generate-ocpp-types/wsdl/ are published by the Open
Charge Alliance (OCA) as part of the OCPP 1.5 and 1.6 SOAP transport bindings,
and are redistributed here unmodified. The code generator reads them at build
time to derive per-message XML namespace URNs and element names, which are then
baked into the generated Go types so a single struct set works for both OCPP-J
(JSON over WebSocket) and OCPP-S (SOAP over HTTP).

Covered WSDL sets:

  - OCPP 1.5 (cmd/generate-ocpp-types/wsdl/1.5/)
  - OCPP 1.6 (cmd/generate-ocpp-types/wsdl/1.6/)

The OCPP 1.5 and 1.6 WSDLs are distributed by the Open Charge Alliance under
their published usage terms. See:

    https://openchargealliance.org/

